plugin-hostd (0.1.6) unstable; urgency=medium

  * The CLAP worker and its test fixtures now come from the installed
    omx-clap-core packages (omx-clap-host and omx-clap-host-tests) instead of
    a pinned checkout. There are no pins anywhere in the build.
  * The packages require omx-clap-host-tests >= 0.6.0 and below 0.7 for the
    tests.

